o<nudge_ac> sub
; Simultaneous relative move: A by #1 degrees, C by #2 degrees, then restore G90.
; Separate G91/G90 lines avoid the same-modal-group MDI error. Both axes in one
; G0 = coordinated (they start together). Used to drive A and C back to the
; parameterized zero (head_zero.inc) in one command.
G91
G0 A#1 C#2
G90
o<nudge_ac> endsub
